William Adams <wadams@ATLIS.COM> asks:

>> Is there some particular reason why _Mathematical Writing_
>> ... didn't make the list?

That publication is in texbook3.bib, but not in typeset.bib, because
it isn't about typesetting math, and rather, on writing math.  Another
book in that vein is Higham's ``Handbook of Writing for the
Mathematical Sciences'', which is also found in texbook3.bib.

[For list readers, you may want to look at recent additions to
typeset.bib at

        http://www.math.utah.edu/pub/tex/bib/index-table-t.html#typeset

It contains several new entries for material discussed online and
offline on the topic of math typesetting.  Look for entries with
bibdates of October 2003.]

